{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1065275/block/singleImage/3275611/df/01M4BVW6VGCGVVS61WKS1QN7JR.jpg?updatedAt=1795430145\"/><figcaption>One Stanley發展商遭勒索數千萬，警列「求警調查」。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>赤柱豪宅項目 One Stanley 被爆出有獨立屋存在建築質素問題，屋宇署下令調查。據報，發展商建灝地產遭人勒索數千萬元，不支付就會向外界披露會對公司有負面影響的資料。 建灝地產發言人確認，公司於 11 月 4 日就被勒索一事報警，案件已交予警方處理，不會作出評論。警方亦確認接獲有關報案，案件列作「求警調查」，暫未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:33:25.695695+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T10:35:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:36.639018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:26:48.455857+00:00","content_hash":"cbf45c1f1e608a1106bb7aacb9ff1b209dc27db479efb77bbd101db23b7bc4d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}